  \resources\RenamePC_COMPUTER_NAME_TOO_LONG_ErrorText:
    Candidate Language=IS-IS: Heiti tölvunnar sem fært var inn er of langt.
  \resources\RenamePC_COMPUTER_NAME_SAME_AS_PC_NAME_ErrorText:
